---
title: "C4 Dynamic — Picking a model for a subagent"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Coding harness<br/>(parent agent)
  participant A as Harness adapter<br/>[hook]
  participant E as run_decision.py<br/>[decision engine]
  participant S as Evidence store<br/>[results.json]
  participant F as fetch_evidence.py
  participant P as Model provider
  H->>A: Spawns subagent with task + type
  A->>E: Requests pick (task, constraints) [JSON]
  E->>S: Reads candidate features, checks as_of
  opt Stale or allowed list changed
    E-)F: Starts background refresh
    F-)S: Writes new results.json atomically
  end
  E->>E: Mask, encode, score, calibrate, rank
  E-->>A: pick, confidence, runners-up (or fallback + reason)
  A->>H: Rewrites subagent model+provider
  H->>P: Runs subagent [HTTPS]
  P-->>H: Result (actual model logged)
